				<li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
					<def>GameStartDialog</def>
					<text>The neurosimulations, holo-games, and free-orgies were never enough for you. You wanted more - the grit and consequence of real life, like they talk about in the history books. You wanted to know what real challenge and consequence feel like.

Now, after a journey of decades in cryptosleep, you're landing on this unknown rimworld. Real consequences await you.</text>
