				<li>
					<id>7</id>
					<name>Saving a Scout</name>
					<appearanceTick>2907000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>2907046</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptanceExpireTick>2925000</acceptanceExpireTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>2909896</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>A 35-year-old scout named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ian&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. He is being chased by pirates from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Deadly Heros&lt;/color&gt;!

He begs for safety and offers to join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lampblack&lt;/color&gt;.

If you accept, you'll have to fight off the pirates on his tail. The group of pirates is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 drifter&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 scavenger gunner&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 scavenger thrashers&lt;/color&gt;

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ian&lt;/color&gt; is too frantic to offer more information.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_Raid_Joiner</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>8</id>
					<name>Saving Seraph</name>
					<appearanceTick>3087000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>3087000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Fail</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>3807000</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A prisoner being held by &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Coalition of Dore&lt;/color&gt; has managed to steal a radio and call you!

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Seraph&lt;/color&gt; is being held at a camp near &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lampblack&lt;/color&gt; under armed guard. Rescue him, and he will join your colony. He is a 49-year-old combat negotiator. He says that there's an enemy outpost at the site guarded by &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 tribesman&lt;/color&gt; and there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.

If you miss this opportunity, you may never hear from &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Seraph&lt;/color&gt; again.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_PrisonerWillingToJoin</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts>
						<li Class="QuestPart_SpawnWorldObject">
							<inSignal>Quest8.Initiate</inSignal>
